/F2 9.8 Tf (THE COMPANY'S RULES AND THEIR RESPECTIVE PUNISHMENTS IF BROKEN BY THE CUSTOMERS) Tj T*
/F1 8.8 Tf
(1. No using multiple accounts in the same device. If done, the company will either) Tj T*
(   suspend or fire a customer out of the company.) Tj T*
(2. No lending money to any other person to buy machines. If done, the company will) Tj T*
(   decrease the team size of the customer\(s\) by 5 members or suspend or fire a victim.) Tj T*
(3. No withdrawing money from different accounts using a single sim card. If done,) Tj T*
(   the victim account will be considered a multiple account and it will face the) Tj T*
(   same repercussions \(suspend or fire a customer out of the company\).) Tj T*
(4. No using voice mails and any other local language in the company's WhatsApp group) Tj T*
(   but English as an official language. If done, this will lead to suspension of the) Tj T*
(   victim from the WhatsApp group \(or suspend or fire the customer out of the company\).) Tj T*
(5. If any customer spends 2 weeks when his or her account is inactive \(no machine) Tj T*
(   running on it\), this person will no longer be considered an eligible customer. The) Tj T*
(   customer's account who invited him or her will be deducted by 1 if the number is 1.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
/F2 9.8 Tf (HOW TO EARN MORE IN AVOR INVESTMENTS) Tj T*
/F1 8.8 Tf
(1. Inviting more people to upgrade to CLASS levels \(A-I\) and get rewards accordingly.) Tj T*
(2. Inviting more customers and earn more commission of 8%.) Tj T*
(3. Buying multiple machines to earn more profits accordingly.) Tj T*
(4. Inviting 4 or more customers in a month to earn monthly reward of 5% the machine cost.) Tj T*
(5. Inviting people to buy same machines like that of the inviter to earn team income) Tj T*
(   whenever the invited customers' machine cycle elapses.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
