/F2 9.8 Tf (2. OFFICIAL WITHDRAW RULES & PLATFORM BONUSES) Tj T*
/F1 8.8 Tf
(- Rule 1: Withdraws run from Mon - Fri.) Tj T*
(- Rule 2: Withdraw percentage - 10%.) Tj T*
(- Rule 3: Minimum withdraw is 3k \(3,000 UGX\) and Maximum withdraw is 5M \(5,000,000 UGX\).) Tj T*
